OL,3,GNEWSAPeople gather over child
OL,4,Asafeguarding concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Jersey have gathered to raise
OL,7,Fconcerns about children's safeguarding
OL,8,Fin the island.
OL,10,FMore than 20 people went to the Stand
OL,11,FTogether for our Children gathering in
OL,12,Fthe Royal Square in St Helier.
OL,14,FCampaigners said they were showing
OL,15,Fsolidarity with people affected by what
OL,16,Fthey thought were serious failings and
OL,17,Fcalled for greater accountability,
OL,18,Fstronger protections for whistleblowers
OL,19,Fand reforms to better protect children
OL,20,Fand families.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
