OL,3,GNEWSAPeople gather over child
OL,4,Asafeguarding concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government's previously said it
OL,7,Fremained "committed to maintaining a
OL,8,Fculture of openness, accountability and
OL,9,Fcontinuous improvement, where people
OL,10,Ffeel safe to speak up and know concerns
OL,11,Fwill be acted upon".
